    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGuirk Beggan Property is delighted to present 64 Greentrees Road to the market. This much-loved 4-bedroom semi-detached family home has been cherished and beautifully maintained over the years and offers wonderfully proportioned accommodation with a warm and welcoming feel throughout.\n\nThe property has been extended to provide a kitchen with breakfast room and excellent family living accommodation, while the garage and ample off-street parking for 3-4 cars add further practicality. To the rear is a particularly special feature of the property a glorious approximately 60ft south-facing garden which enjoys an excellent sunny aspect and provides a wonderful setting for outdoor living, children`s play and entertaining.\nWhile the house would now benefit from some updating and modernisation, it is important to appreciate that this is a home that can be comfortably moved into from day one. It has been lovingly cared for and maintained, offering the successful purchaser the opportunity to settle in immediately while, over time, putting their own stamp on the property and creating a home perfectly suited to their individual needs.\n\nThe accommodation offers tremendous scope for a growing family, with the existing living space and the garage offering further potential for those who may wish to consider extending or reconfiguring in the future, subject to the necessary planning requirements.\n\nGreentrees Road is a highly regarded residential road of quality family homes, conveniently located close to a wealth of amenities. The Orwell Shopping Centre, Centra supermarket, St. Judes GAA Club and St. Mary`s Rugby Club are all within easy reach. The property is also ideally positioned for a selection of well-established junior and senior schools including Our Lady`s School, Templeogue College, Terenure College, St Pius X and Bishop Shanahan`s/Galvin`s. There are excellent recreational and shopping facilities nearby, with both Bushy Park and Tymon Park close at hand, while Ashleaf and Rathfarnham Shopping Centres and the many amenities of Terenure and Templeogue villages are just a short drive away. The area is well served by frequent bus routes, with the 15A bus stop conveniently located close to the property, while the M50 motorway is also within easy reach, providing access to the wider road network.\n\nA genuinely lovely family home that has been beautifully cared for and occupying a wonderful position on one of the area`s most popular residential roads. With its generous accommodation, sunny south-facing garden, garage and substantial off-street parking, No.64 offers a rare opportunity to acquire a home with excellent existing qualities and exciting potential for the future.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
