        "Content": "<ul><li> Superb 4-bedroom semi-detached family home </li><li> Glorious approx. 60ft south-facing rear garden </li><li> Generous and practical family accommodation </li><li> Garage with excellent potential for conversion, subject to planning permission </li><li> Ample off-street parking for 3-4 cars to the front </li><li> Gas fired central heating (GFCH) </li><li> Lovingly cared-for family home </li><li> Move-in ready, while offering scope for modernisation </li><li> Prime family location close to excellent amenities </li><li> Two block-built sheds</li></ul>"
